{
  "about": "Client profiles for scripts/install.mjs. Each profile records how one client discovers role files, skills, routers and permissions, written against the official documentation listed in `docs` on `checkedOn`. Bootstrap re-checks the profile against the current documentation of every selected client and records any difference as an `overrides` entry in the answers file; the installer applies the overrides on top of the profile. A client without a profile is rendered by the agent under contracts/client-bindings.md. `skills.discovers` lists the other project folders a client documents reading skills from, with any limit on that; `runtime.partLimit` is the largest runtime answer, in bytes, the client shows whole.",
